patiotemporal features. Extensive numerical simulations demonstrate that the proposed intelligent model significantly outperforms traditional benchmark schemes in terms of prediction accuracy and system throughput under extreme attenuation and highdynamic scenarios. Finally, the results confirm the significant advantages of this scheme in maintaining ultra-low end-to-end response latency, providing a robust solution for optimizing THz communication performance in complex maritime or urban environments.},
